# NounoursOS : NounoursBrowser par défaut, Firefox ESR en secours
[Default Applications]
x-scheme-handler/http=nounours-browser.desktop;firefox-esr.desktop;
x-scheme-handler/https=nounours-browser.desktop;firefox-esr.desktop;
text/html=nounours-browser.desktop;firefox-esr.desktop;
application/xhtml+xml=nounours-browser.desktop;firefox-esr.desktop;
